  "description": "[Pre-serialization](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list?titleId=807616)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=822833), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10861286)\n\nEveryone Saree meets is a little strange. Song Sari is an ordinary 21-year-old college student who always admires someone perfect and cool and criticizes herself for not being like that. Saree meets many different people throughout the year, but they are all a little strange. Will they become the villains that will never be seen in Saree's life ? Or will they become precious jewels ?",
